C     ELEMENT
C
C     LOOKING DOWN ON THIS ELEMENT, GRIDS 1,2,3 ARE THE BASE AND MUST BE
C     LABELED COUNTERCLOCKWISE. GRID 4 MUST BE ABOVE THE PLANE FORMED BY
C     GRIDS 1,2,3 AND CLOSEST TO THIS OBSERVER.
